# The context of every image built from the repo root: the apps that prune the
# Bun workspace, and images/mate-sandbox, which compiles packages/mate-hands.
# Ship just those trees; everything else (k8s, terraform, nix, .git, build
# output) stays out of context.
*
!apps
!packages
!package.json
!bun.lock
!turbo.json
!images/mate-sandbox/gh
!images/mate-sandbox/kthx
!images/mate-sandbox/mise.toml

# Even within the whitelisted trees, never send dependency/build artifacts.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.cache
**/*.log
